{
    "title": "Beauty Salon Game for Toddlers",
    "description": "The most creative Fashion Salon in town is now OPEN! Jump in to create amazing looks, glamorous nails, stylish photo shoots, and more!\r\n\r\nRecreate your favorite looks from real life, or let your imagination run loose as you experiment with the nearly endless combination of clothes, accessories, styles, colors, stickers, gems, jewels, and so much more!\r\n\r\nDesigned for preschoolers and toddlers to get creative. Your little one will love to roleplay life in the spa by creating unique nail designs, dressing up, and taking fashion photos over and over again. It's creative screen time you can feel good about.\r\n\r\nWHAT\u2019S INSIDE THE APP\r\nA glamorous Fashion Salon jam-packed with everything you need to glow up!\r\nDRESS-UP AREA \u2014 Choose your new hairstyle, clothes, and shoes then accessorize! There is everything from classic to crazy\r\nBEAUTY SPA \u2014 Drag your character onto the beauty bed and give her the ultimate spa treatment, the perfect way to start the day.\r\nMAKEUP SALON \u2014 Get creative and design your favorite look! Apply eyeliner, lipstick, glitter, and much more! You can even choose her jewelry and hat!\r\nNAIL SALON \u2014 Choose the shape and length of each nail, then paint, polish, and decorate however you like.\r\nPHOTO STUDIO \u2014 Don\u2019t forget to take a photo! Drag your gorgeous girl into the photo studio, pick your favorite backdrop, give her a pose, and SNAP!\r\nHANG OUT ZONE \u2014 What a day! Time to relax in the Hang Out Zone, grab a snack, or take a dip in the pool, you earned it!\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES:\r\n- Ad-free with no disruptions, enjoy uninterrupted play\r\n- Promotes creativity and boosts imagination\r\n- Makeup and beauty salon roleplays and games\r\n- Non-competitive gameplay \u2014 just open-ended fun!\r\n- Kid-friendly, colorful, and enchanting design\r\n- No parental support needed, simple and intuitive gameplay\r\n- Play offline, no wifi needed \u2014 perfect for traveling\r\n\r\nABOUT US\r\nWe make apps and games that kids and parents love! Our range of products lets kids of all ages learn, grow, and play. Check out our Developers Page to see more.\r\n \r\nContact us: hello@bekids.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "The most creative Fashion Salon in town is now OPEN! Jump in to create amazing looks, glamorous nails, stylish photo shoots, and more!<br><br>Recreate your favorite looks from real life, or let your imagination run loose as you experiment with the nearly endless combination of clothes, accessories, styles, colors, stickers, gems, jewels, and so much more!<br><br>Designed for preschoolers and toddlers to get creative. Your little one will love to roleplay life in the spa by creating unique nail designs, dressing up, and taking fashion photos over and over again. It&#39;s creative screen time you can feel good about.<br><br>WHAT\u2019S INSIDE THE APP<br>A glamorous Fashion Salon jam-packed with everything you need to glow up!<br>DRESS-UP AREA \u2014 Choose your new hairstyle, clothes, and shoes then accessorize! There is everything from classic to crazy<br>BEAUTY SPA \u2014 Drag your character onto the beauty bed and give her the ultimate spa treatment, the perfect way to start the day.<br>MAKEUP SALON \u2014 Get creative and design your favorite look! Apply eyeliner, lipstick, glitter, and much more! You can even choose her jewelry and hat!<br>NAIL SALON \u2014 Choose the shape and length of each nail, then paint, polish, and decorate however you like.<br>PHOTO STUDIO \u2014 Don\u2019t forget to take a photo! Drag your gorgeous girl into the photo studio, pick your favorite backdrop, give her a pose, and SNAP!<br>HANG OUT ZONE \u2014 What a day! Time to relax in the Hang Out Zone, grab a snack, or take a dip in the pool, you earned it!<br><br>KEY FEATURES:<br>- Ad-free with no disruptions, enjoy uninterrupted play<br>- Promotes creativity and boosts imagination<br>- Makeup and beauty salon roleplays and games<br>- Non-competitive gameplay \u2014 just open-ended fun!<br>- Kid-friendly, colorful, and enchanting design<br>- No parental support needed, simple and intuitive gameplay<br>- Play offline, no wifi needed \u2014 perfect for traveling<br><br>ABOUT US<br>We make apps and games that kids and parents love! Our range of products lets kids of all ages learn, grow, and play. Check out our Developers Page to see more.<br> <br>Contact us: hello@bekids.com",
